    <briefdescription>
<para>Directed link between two GPU devices (intra-node) or two nodes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For intra-node links src_device_index and dst_device_index are driver device ordinals. For inter-node links src_node_id / dst_node_id identify the participating cluster nodes; device indices are set to -1. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
